role:bpa a org:Role ;
    dcterms:source src:downstream-process-map ;
    skos:altLabel "BP&A"@en ;
    skos:definition "A team that captures, analyzes, forecasts and reports financial and operational data in support of a commercial organization."@en ;
    skos:editorialNote "BP&A expanded as Business Planning and Analysis (Hamid, 2026-10-18 (EPM-DEC-001-0045)). externally corroborated: MPC job postings read \"The Business Planning and Analysis (BP&A) team is responsible for capturing, analyzing, forecasting, and reporting financial and operational data in support of the\" commercial organization they serve (LinkedIn job 4452695204, posted 2025-07-23, read through a search index; third-party host). The definition is Claude's, adapted from that sentence. Whether the RACI entry means the team or one position is not settled; kept as a team."@en ;
    skos:prefLabel "Business Planning and Analysis"@en ;
    skos:scopeNote "The source names a team here, not a position. The role stands for the team acting as one party in a RACI chart."@en .

role:business-analyst a org:Role ;
    dcterms:source src:downstream-process-map ;
    skos:editorialNote "In \"Business Analyst (RO)\", RO means Regional Optimization (Hamid, 2026-10-18 (EPM-DEC-001-0045): \"Q6: RO = Regional Optimization\")."@en ;
    skos:prefLabel "Business Analyst"@en .

role:cci-director a org:Role ;
    dcterms:source src:downstream-process-map ;
    skos:altLabel "CCI Director"@en ;
    skos:editorialNote "CCI expanded as Continual Commercial Improvement (Hamid, 2026-10-18 (EPM-DEC-001-0045)). externally corroborated: an MPC job posting reads \"The Continual Commercial Improvement (CCI) Engineer\" (builtin.com job 7627760, read 2026-10-18, third-party host). \"Continual\", not \"Continuous\"."@en ;
    skos:prefLabel "Continual Commercial Improvement Director"@en .

